  "description": "Conformance suite for OutWit.Shared.Secrets providers: NUnit fixtures a provider's test project inherits and points at its own store. The abstraction's promises — status model, atomic replace, size and key limits, case injectivity — are tested against every implementation by that implementation's own author, rather than restated in each one's tests. A provider whose Description.CanWrite is false runs the read-side tests only.",
